WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:02.990
Priestesses of the Godless Month

00:02.991 --> 00:04.990
Kannazuki no Miko

00:06.450 --> 00:09.050
Now that Orochi's existence was revealed...

00:09.460 --> 00:13.490
In case the Orochi attacks again...

00:14.100 --> 00:19.160
we decided to create a barrier
for the villagers to escape behind.

00:52.030 --> 00:53.120
Himeko.

00:54.370 --> 00:56.440
Take a look above.

00:57.520 --> 00:58.950
Wow...

01:04.580 --> 01:06.609
When something happens, we'll have...

01:06.610 --> 01:08.960
the villagers escape
inside this barrier.

01:09.170 --> 01:10.449
Was it...

01:10.450 --> 01:11.850
Was it done well?

01:12.390 --> 01:13.390
Yes.

01:13.790 --> 01:15.270
I'm glad...

01:15.690 --> 01:16.950
Himeko!

01:17.990 --> 01:20.560
I'm fine. I'm just relieved.

01:21.130 --> 01:26.900
Since I always gave you a hard
time and couldn't help you out...

01:27.300 --> 01:30.340
I felt I was finally able
to give you a little hand.

01:34.040 --> 01:38.070
I could do this because I was with you.
Because you were here.

01:38.750 --> 01:40.070
Chikane-chan.

02:14.850 --> 02:18.920
Haruka ni sotto yurameku urei
kattou no kioku ni ugokasare

02:18.921 --> 02:22.989
Moving the slowly unfolding, distressing
troubles from afar that were in the past

02:22.990 --> 02:26.055
mabuta ni zutto haritsuku
shiroi zekkyou ni kogoeta

02:26.056 --> 02:29.119
Strongly closing the eyelids,
the white screams have frozen

02:29.120 --> 02:31.240
- shizumu tsuki no mayoi
- The confusion of the setting moon

02:31.860 --> 02:33.640
Sonzai wa tashikani Ima koko ni

02:33.641 --> 02:35.419
Surely my existence is here now

02:35.420 --> 02:37.130
- matte iru no wa
- Waiting for me

02:37.133 --> 02:38.465
Namida nado mou nagasanai

02:38.466 --> 02:39.799
There's no more tears to cry

02:39.800 --> 02:41.925
tada dakiaeru shunkan

02:41.926 --> 02:44.050
When the moment comes when
we embrace each other

02:44.500 --> 02:46.650
ienai kikenai mienai maboroshi dake

02:46.651 --> 02:48.800
Unspoken, unheard, unseen, just an illusion

02:49.020 --> 02:51.470
toki no mukou kawa e to nagasarete

02:51.471 --> 02:53.919
Flowing towards the other side of time,

02:53.920 --> 02:56.240
mayoigo ni naru yurusenu negai

02:56.241 --> 02:58.560
becoming like a lost
child, an unforgiven wish

02:58.860 --> 03:01.050
koe dake yubi dake chikazuku ondo dake

03:01.051 --> 03:03.239
Only voice, only fingers,
only the approaching warmth

03:03.240 --> 03:07.535
todokanu omoi ga chigirarete
yokaze o someru

03:07.536 --> 03:11.830
Unspoken thoughts get tainted
by the shredded night wind

03:32.690 --> 03:36.980
I'll ask Otoha-san to pack
breakfast, so let's hurry.

03:37.630 --> 03:40.200
Sorry, I'm such a slow runner.

03:42.070 --> 03:43.610
Oogami-kun.

03:44.770 --> 03:46.120
Did something happen?

03:49.420 --> 03:50.640
I see.

03:52.410 --> 03:53.809
Kurusugawa-san.

03:53.810 --> 03:54.810
Right.

03:55.180 --> 03:56.590
See you at school.

03:59.250 --> 04:00.250
Kurusugawa!

04:02.660 --> 04:06.210
Since your birthday turned out like that...

04:06.530 --> 04:07.530
Here.

04:09.330 --> 04:10.799
Oogami-kun...

04:10.800 --> 04:12.770
I'll be waiting next Sunday.

04:18.470 --> 04:19.890
Oogami-kun...

04:20.290 --> 04:22.785
Fourth Episode

04:22.786 --> 04:25.280
Direction of Affection

04:35.850 --> 04:36.000
Invitation Ticket

04:38.830 --> 04:40.880
I'll be waiting next Sunday.

04:41.560 --> 04:42.880
What should I do?

04:44.030 --> 04:47.869
Sensei, Kurusugawa-san's
secretly reading something.

04:47.870 --> 04:50.069
What is it, Kurusugawa?

04:50.070 --> 04:51.890
I-It's nothing.

04:52.670 --> 04:55.309
The test is coming up, so focus.

04:55.310 --> 04:57.400
All right, we're moving on.

05:14.700 --> 05:15.920
What's wrong?

05:17.700 --> 05:22.240
Eat something or you won't last
through afternoon classes.

05:24.970 --> 05:26.180
What will you wear?

05:27.580 --> 05:31.309
It's a date, so you have
to wear something nice.

05:31.310 --> 05:33.149
A-A date?

05:33.150 --> 05:34.330
Isn't it?

05:34.620 --> 05:38.019
B-But you and Oogami-kun are...

05:38.020 --> 05:39.020
Me?

05:39.250 --> 05:41.689
People at school are saying...

05:41.690 --> 05:44.690
that you're the best
couple and a great match.

05:44.990 --> 05:47.559
Oh, you were worried about that?

05:47.560 --> 05:49.299
It's just a rumor.

05:49.300 --> 05:51.080
There's nothing between us.

05:51.400 --> 05:52.860
I see.

05:55.440 --> 05:56.580
Do you want to go?

05:58.870 --> 06:00.090
You do want to go, right?

06:02.140 --> 06:05.090
Oogami-kun was always beside me.

06:05.880 --> 06:09.110
It was fun when I was with him.

06:09.480 --> 06:11.100
I wasn't afraid.

06:11.590 --> 06:15.100
No matter how hard the
times were afterward.

06:16.260 --> 06:18.759
Then there's no reason to hesitate.

06:18.760 --> 06:19.760
But...

06:20.590 --> 06:21.610
Himeko.

06:22.800 --> 06:26.129
When you're smiling, it makes me happy.

06:26.130 --> 06:27.130
Is that not enough?

06:27.970 --> 06:29.110
Chikane-chan...

06:31.310 --> 06:32.620
It's decided?

06:35.700 --> 06:37.640
What did you say?

06:38.080 --> 06:40.389
Is the First Neck serious?

06:40.390 --> 06:43.630
Well, given that, the
priestesses' lives are over.

06:44.020 --> 06:45.780
End of story.

06:46.320 --> 06:49.130
It's going to end? That's boring, meow.

06:49.560 --> 06:51.359
Don't give me that!

06:51.360 --> 06:55.260
Forget the Lunar Boob. I won't
let him finish off my Hime-chan.

06:56.450 --> 06:57.930
Wait a minute.

06:58.230 --> 07:01.169
Tsubasa-sama's aim isn't the priestesses.

07:01.170 --> 07:02.940
It's likely the Seventh Neck.

07:03.220 --> 07:04.440
The Seventh Neck?

07:04.640 --> 07:06.109
That's right.

07:06.110 --> 07:10.450
The Seventh Neck is a special
person to Tsubasa-sama.

07:11.210 --> 07:13.450
What? All of this?

07:14.520 --> 07:15.849
Wow.

07:15.850 --> 07:17.450
Pick anything you like.

07:18.020 --> 07:21.089
If the sizes don't match,
I'll have them fixed.

07:21.090 --> 07:22.160
But...

07:22.660 --> 07:24.389
That's right, Otoha-san.

07:24.390 --> 07:26.460
Take Kurusugawa-san's measurements.

07:27.260 --> 07:28.900
As you wish.

07:29.730 --> 07:31.970
Kurusugawa-sama, please
take your clothes off.

07:32.290 --> 07:34.660
Eh? I-In here?

07:35.010 --> 07:36.010
Yes.

07:36.170 --> 07:38.470
I-It can't be done with clothes on?

07:38.970 --> 07:41.179
To prepare for the future...

07:41.180 --> 07:43.980
it's best to get accurate measurements.

07:46.180 --> 07:47.479
Don't worry.

07:47.480 --> 07:49.990
There's nobody here except us.

08:06.600 --> 08:07.960
Is this okay?

08:08.570 --> 08:11.470
Can you take your bra off, too?

08:11.770 --> 08:13.380
W-What?

08:20.380 --> 08:22.910
This is embarrassing. My heart's racing.

08:28.890 --> 08:31.580
Eight centimeters smaller
than Ojousama's, it seems.

08:33.330 --> 08:34.570
I see.

08:37.800 --> 08:41.250
Can you adjust this to
Kurusugawa-san's size?

08:41.670 --> 08:43.700
Yes, as you wish.

08:45.340 --> 08:49.539
But this is an important dress
you received from the master.

08:49.540 --> 08:52.409
It's fine. It flatters Kurusugawa-san.

08:52.410 --> 08:53.410
But still...

08:53.750 --> 08:57.260
It's okay, Chikane-chan. I'll
go in my school uniform.

08:57.650 --> 08:58.650
No.

08:58.950 --> 09:01.989
Well, let's choose accessories next.

09:01.990 --> 09:04.429
Please take care of that, Otoha-san.

09:04.430 --> 09:05.760
As you wish.

09:08.460 --> 09:10.080
Excuse me.

09:17.010 --> 09:18.700
79cm Washboard Flat

09:29.380 --> 09:30.819
There, all done.

09:30.820 --> 09:32.190
T-Thank you.

09:38.590 --> 09:40.130
Wow...

09:40.630 --> 09:44.520
Look, it does flatter you.
Now for your hairstyle.

09:47.000 --> 09:51.020
It's boring to keep it the same as usual.
How about tying it?

09:54.940 --> 09:56.320
No!

09:58.220 --> 09:59.410
Himeko.

10:00.250 --> 10:01.570
I'm sorry.

10:01.850 --> 10:03.979
I'll do my hair myself.

10:03.980 --> 10:05.450
Sorry...

10:08.930 --> 10:09.930
Meeting

10:08.930 --> 10:09.930
Attractions

10:08.930 --> 10:09.930
Meeting

10:08.930 --> 10:09.930
Attractions

10:09.931 --> 10:10.930
Arrival

10:09.931 --> 10:10.930
Lunch

10:09.931 --> 10:10.930
Toilet

10:09.931 --> 10:10.930
Arrival

10:09.931 --> 10:10.930
Lunch

10:09.931 --> 10:10.931
Toilet

10:12.060 --> 10:13.420
Kurusugawa...

10:15.110 --> 10:18.429
1:35 PM, bathroom break.

10:18.430 --> 10:19.590
What's that?

10:20.570 --> 10:22.759
I-It's nothing!

10:22.760 --> 10:25.309
How fishy. Plans for a date?

10:25.310 --> 10:26.600
N-No.

10:27.010 --> 10:29.100
Perhaps Kurusugawa-san?

10:30.950 --> 10:35.479
You really have to work on your
conversational skills, Souma-san.

10:35.480 --> 10:37.689
Listen, in those times...

10:37.690 --> 10:39.629
Jeez, you're nosy.

10:39.630 --> 10:40.689
Hey...

10:40.690 --> 10:42.860
Just leave please.

11:02.310 --> 11:04.609
What was that just now?

11:04.610 --> 11:05.580
Souma-san?

11:05.581 --> 11:07.520
I-It's nothing.

11:46.120 --> 11:48.210
Souma, why?

11:50.790 --> 11:52.100
Why did you...

12:17.020 --> 12:18.750
I'm going now.

12:23.520 --> 12:25.550
I'll be back before dark.

12:25.990 --> 12:27.570
Have fun.

12:31.100 --> 12:32.320
Um...

12:33.730 --> 12:36.000
About yesterday, I...

12:36.340 --> 12:38.730
Yesterday? Did something happen?

12:40.810 --> 12:44.740
Here. The sun's strong, so you
have to properly wear the hat.

12:45.780 --> 12:47.260
Chikane-chan.

12:47.550 --> 12:49.280
Go on. You'll be late.

12:51.420 --> 12:54.450
I'm glad. It seems she's not worried.

12:54.860 --> 12:56.750
Well, see you later.

13:01.760 --> 13:04.340
Oogami-kun was always beside me.

13:04.500 --> 13:05.500
No!

13:32.930 --> 13:37.190
Starting with a roller coaster
might be too much, but...

13:39.600 --> 13:40.600
Um...

13:40.930 --> 13:44.010
Then that won't give us enough time.

13:44.030 --> 13:47.010
Um, O-Oogami-kun...

13:48.210 --> 13:51.710
I should've made the meeting
time an hour earlier.

13:52.150 --> 13:53.370
Oogami-kun!

13:55.450 --> 13:56.520
O-Oh...

13:58.020 --> 13:59.850
S-Shall we go?

14:56.710 --> 14:58.279
It's almost done.

14:58.280 --> 15:00.449
You can start eating now.

15:00.450 --> 15:02.750
It's okay. You start first.

15:04.050 --> 15:05.250
You start.

15:07.850 --> 15:08.850
Shoot!

15:10.520 --> 15:11.430
Sorry!

15:11.431 --> 15:12.760
Sorry! It's fine. I'll eat it.

15:13.160 --> 15:15.229
It's fine. I'll eat it.

15:15.230 --> 15:16.770
Because it's my fault.

15:17.100 --> 15:18.320
It's fine.

15:22.240 --> 15:23.769
R-Rice.

15:23.770 --> 15:25.460
Oh, right.

15:32.380 --> 15:34.069
The rice tastes normal.

15:34.070 --> 15:35.240
Oogami-kun...

15:35.980 --> 15:40.750
Come to think of it, you ate
rice that way as a child, too.

15:41.120 --> 15:42.750
D-Did I?

15:43.520 --> 15:46.920
You put so much effort into everything.

15:47.330 --> 15:49.260
You worried me sometimes.

15:50.560 --> 15:51.760
Of course I do.

15:54.470 --> 15:58.270
I decided to protect you
no matter what happens.

15:59.170 --> 16:00.770
Oogami-kun...

16:12.650 --> 16:15.320
I hope Souma-san is doing well.

16:17.590 --> 16:19.120
Sensei, what's...

16:42.780 --> 16:44.100
Tsubasa-kun.

17:00.290 --> 17:01.370
No!

17:15.020 --> 17:16.410
Himeko...

17:20.250 --> 17:22.430
The tea is ready.

17:24.020 --> 17:25.020
All right.

17:33.570 --> 17:34.790
Here you go.

17:38.170 --> 17:39.170
This is...

17:39.340 --> 17:41.239
It will warm you up.

17:41.240 --> 17:43.950
Please keep it a secret from the others.

17:45.050 --> 17:46.270
Thank you.

17:49.120 --> 17:50.460
Ojousama...

17:56.490 --> 17:57.420
Just now...

17:57.421 --> 17:58.520
Ojousama?

17:59.200 --> 18:01.970
Otoha-san, help me prepare
to leave right away.

18:09.830 --> 18:12.409
Wow, it's so pretty.

18:12.410 --> 18:13.340
Yeah.

18:13.341 --> 18:14.820
That's the school.

18:15.310 --> 18:17.279
That's Chikane-chan's house.

18:17.280 --> 18:18.870
Your house is...

18:19.280 --> 18:20.350
There.

18:23.880 --> 18:25.440
Do you remember?

18:26.420 --> 18:30.040
There was a time when we
saw a sunset like today's.

18:36.560 --> 18:38.960
Wow, the whole village is red!

18:40.830 --> 18:43.520
This view will be our secret.

18:44.770 --> 18:49.209
If your family now is mean,
or if you have tough times, come here.

18:49.210 --> 18:50.940
I'll wait anytime.

18:58.490 --> 19:02.250
My feelings have always
been the same since then.

19:03.460 --> 19:04.840
Oogami-kun...

19:07.860 --> 19:10.810
It's late, but happy birthday.

19:18.910 --> 19:20.080
Wow.

19:29.470 --> 19:33.950
I didn't deserve to live was

19:35.140 --> 19:36.820
what I always thought.

19:37.720 --> 19:40.849
I thought everyone hated me.

19:40.850 --> 19:45.700
And that there wouldn't be
anyone who would ever love me.

19:47.470 --> 19:51.199
But after meeting people
like you and Chikane-chan...

19:51.200 --> 19:55.880
I can believe a little
that it's not true.

19:56.380 --> 19:57.879
Kurusugawa...

19:57.880 --> 20:00.049
I can't always be afraid, right?

20:00.050 --> 20:01.880
About what happened then.

20:02.750 --> 20:05.820
Can you put it on for me?

20:24.540 --> 20:25.540
Thank you.

20:30.780 --> 20:33.960
Kurusugawa, I've always...

20:36.680 --> 20:37.840
Himeko...

20:42.990 --> 20:43.990
Oogami-kun...

20:45.490 --> 20:47.350
Oogami-kun! Oogami-kun!

20:47.690 --> 20:49.160
Oogami-kun...

20:53.000 --> 20:54.000
That's...

21:07.850 --> 21:09.990
We have to run, Oogami-kun.

21:10.220 --> 21:13.450
No, he's different from the others.

21:24.370 --> 21:25.370
I...

21:25.870 --> 21:27.999
I'll protect you.

21:28.000 --> 21:29.610
No matter the foe.

21:29.840 --> 21:31.270
Oogami-kun...

21:33.970 --> 21:35.850
Himeko, run.

21:40.870 --> 21:42.210
Oogami-kun!

21:53.960 --> 21:54.960
What?

22:05.640 --> 22:06.800
Souma.

22:08.380 --> 22:09.680
You're...

22:09.970 --> 22:11.510
- Itsuka mita yume
- A dream that was once saw

22:11.513 --> 22:13.680
- Todokanai tsubuyaki dake
- Just a murmur that does not get through

22:13.683 --> 22:15.495
Yoru no hikari ni tsutsumarete samayoi yuku

22:15.496 --> 22:17.309
Wandering while wrapped up in night's light

22:17.310 --> 22:20.900
- Yagate mihiraku sono hitomi Unmei nara - If it
is fate, those eyes will be opened before long

22:20.903 --> 22:22.420
Semete Sou ima dake

22:22.421 --> 22:23.939
At least... yes, only now

22:23.940 --> 22:26.320
- Kanawanai to utsumuku - Looking
downward as the wish does not come true

22:26.323 --> 22:28.320
- Yokaze ni tada unadare
- Merely hanging my head in the night wind

22:28.323 --> 22:31.990
- Namida Tsukikage Te no hira ni afurete yuku - Tears
and moonlight continue to overflow from my palm

22:31.993 --> 22:33.580
- Nani ga hoshii no
- What do you want?

22:33.583 --> 22:35.790
Kuchibiru wa yami ni furuete ita

22:35.791 --> 22:37.999
My lips shivered in the darkness

22:38.000 --> 22:40.335
Deatta ano toki ni mune tsuita egao

22:40.336 --> 22:42.669
The smiling face that pierced
my chest when we came across

22:42.670 --> 22:45.610
Mamoritakute Zutto kuzuresou na yakusoku o

22:45.611 --> 22:48.549
I want to protect it, the promise
that always looks about to collapse

22:48.550 --> 22:50.595
Itami tsubusu hodo ni dakishimeteta

22:50.596 --> 22:52.640
I embraced it while crushing the pain

22:53.470 --> 22:54.890
Soba ni ireru dake de

22:54.891 --> 22:56.309
Just by being by my side

22:56.310 --> 22:58.125
Onaji jikan ni irareru dake de

22:58.126 --> 22:59.939
Just by remaining in the same time as me

22:59.940 --> 23:03.400
Tooi kioku Yomigaeru kanashimi
mo atatamete yukeru no ni

23:03.401 --> 23:06.859
The distant memory and
revived sadness can warmed

23:06.860 --> 23:08.840
Mawaritsuzukete iru omoi ni

23:08.841 --> 23:10.819
In the feelings that continue to circulate

23:10.820 --> 23:12.635
Yasuragi michita owari wa kuru no

23:12.636 --> 23:14.449
Will a peaceful ending come?

23:14.450 --> 23:16.265
Kurikaeshita toikake wa ten ni mai

23:16.266 --> 23:18.079
The repeated question dance in heavens

23:18.080 --> 23:23.605
Ake no sora no Hikari ni kawaru

23:23.606 --> 23:29.130
And turns into the light of the morning sky

23:40.020 --> 23:41.030
Next Time

23:41.031 --> 23:42.040
Next Time

23:41.100 --> 23:43.020
Because they love each other...

23:43.880 --> 23:45.480
Because they seek one another...

23:46.740 --> 23:53.400
I wish the world would only be
filled with kindness and courage.

23:54.350 --> 23:56.219
Please, Chikane-chan.

23:56.220 --> 23:58.080
Take me with you.

23:59.040 --> 24:06.040
Over the Darkness of Night

23:59.450 --> 24:03.189
Next time on Kannazuki no Miko, episode 5.

24:03.190 --> 24:05.010
Over the Darkness of Night.

24:05.790 --> 24:09.239
Chikane-chan, what am I supposed to do?
